{"id":"beutel","lemma":"Beutel","pos":"noun","rank":4044,"glosses":["a small to medium-sized bag, usually of fabric","pouch (bag with a drawstring)","pouch (body part of a marsupial)"],"ipa":"/ˈbɔʏ̯təl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ed/De-Beutel.ogg/De-Beutel.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Beutels","plural":"Beutel"},"examples":[{"text":"Welcher Beutel ist deiner?","en":"Which bag is yours?","words":[{"g":"which"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"yours, thine"}]},{"text":"Warum ist mein Beutel leer?","en":"Why is my bag empty?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"empty"}]},{"text":"In meinem Beutel sind Erdbeeren.","en":"There are strawberries in my bag.","words":[{"g":"in"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"strawberry","l":"Erdbeere"}]},{"text":"Er legte sein Geld in den Beutel.","en":"He put his money in the bag.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to lie down","l":"legen"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"money"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Die Orangen in diesem Beutel sind angefault.","en":"The oranges in this bag are rotten.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"orange","l":"Orange"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null]}]}